Z||000001||TRiAD||06-04-2001||06:26 AM||||Hey Steve,<BR>That pic is a totally stock '88 GT. No, really. <BR>The nose was done in photoshop, as were the rockers, the fuel lid, the sail panels, the hoodvents, the wheels, the tinted windows, the ride height, the monochromatic treatment of the trim and the mirror and the wing. <BR>This is what I have planned for the car, but it has not been done as of yet. <BR>Glad you like it, I'm looking into getting the nose made, but have had trouble finding anyone who can do bumper material, so it may be fiberglass. <BR>Thanks for the complement, from someone who has gone to the lengths you have to make your car "perfect" for you, that means something!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><B><I>Michael ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</I></B><BR>-----------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88FieroGTwhitefscustomcroppedmini.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 06-04-2001).]||||reg||6
